  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Global Mental health and psychosocial support activities</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project will cover staff time, travel- and activity-related costs of the NLRC MHPSS Advisor in support of the NLRC partner countries&apos; work related to Mental Health and Psychosocial Support (MHPSS as a cross-cutting topic has an amount of EUR 123.290 available (including top-up in 2023). This is a cross-cutting topic of the Partnership between Netherlands Red Cross and the Netherlands Ministry of Foreign Affairs.</narrative>
  </description>
